sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Engineer
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MutWH as Mutating Webhooks<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant ValWH as Validating Webhooks<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant Ctrl as SparkApplication<br/>Controller
    participant Driver as Driver Pod
    participant Exec as Executor Pod(s)

    Note over User,Exec: SparkApplication Submission Flow

    User->>API: kubectl apply SparkApplication CR
    API->>MutWH: Admission review (CREATE)
    MutWH->>MutWH: SparkApplicationDefaulter<br/>injects defaults
    MutWH->>MutWH: SparkPodDefaulter<br/>injects Spark config
    MutWH-->>API: Mutated SparkApplication
    API->>ValWH: Admission review (CREATE)
    ValWH->>ValWH: Validate field constraints
    ValWH->>API: Check ResourceQuota compliance
    API-->>ValWH: ResourceQuota list
    ValWH-->>API: Admission allowed
    API-->>User: SparkApplication created

    Note over Ctrl,Exec: Controller Reconciliation

    API->>Ctrl: Watch event: SparkApplication created
    Ctrl->>API: Create Driver Pod
    Ctrl->>API: Create Service
    Ctrl->>API: Create ConfigMap (monitoring)
    Ctrl->>API: Create PodDisruptionBudget (optional)
    API-->>Driver: Driver Pod scheduled

    Driver->>API: Request Executor Pods
    API->>MutWH: Admission review (Pod CREATE)
    MutWH->>MutWH: SparkPodDefaulter<br/>injects Spark config into pod
    MutWH-->>API: Mutated Pod
    API-->>Exec: Executor Pod(s) scheduled

    Driver->>Exec: Spark task distribution
    Exec-->>Driver: Task results

    Note over Ctrl,Driver: Lifecycle Monitoring

    API->>Ctrl: Watch event: Pod status change
    Ctrl->>API: Update SparkApplication status
    Ctrl->>API: Update finalizers

    Note over User,Exec: ScheduledSparkApplication Flow

    User->>API: kubectl apply ScheduledSparkApplication CR
    API->>MutWH: Admission review (CREATE)
    MutWH-->>API: Mutated CR
    API->>ValWH: Admission review (CREATE)
    ValWH-->>API: Admission allowed

    Note right of Ctrl: Cron trigger fires
    Ctrl->>API: Create SparkApplication from template
    Note right of Ctrl: Follows same flow as above

    Note over User,Exec: Module Lifecycle Flow (Platform Layer)

    participant ODH as ODH Operator
    participant Module as spark-operator-module<br/>controller-manager
    participant CM as cert-manager

    ODH->>API: Create SparkOperator CR (singleton)
    API->>Module: Watch event: SparkOperator created
    Module->>API: Create/Update CRDs
    Module->>API: Create RBAC (ClusterRoles, Bindings)
    Module->>API: Create Deployments (controller, webhook)
    Module->>API: Create Services
    Module->>API: Create NetworkPolicies
    Module->>API: Create cert-manager Certificate/Issuer
    CM->>API: Provision TLS certificate
    CM->>API: Store in spark-operator-webhook-certs Secret
    Module->>API: Update SparkOperator status
